    skos:definition "Data Use Ontology (DUO) modifier codes, plus Sage-local DUOPlus1-7 extensions (see README) and \"Pending Annotation\". Real DUO terms carry `meaning:` pointing at the actual obo:DUO_ IRI (reuse-by-IRI, not re-minting — the same convention sagebrain-model documents for its own external-term reuse)." ;
